// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (Git-ignored) and paste the synthetic test key.
// Prototype only: the key is embedded in this local build. A product would pair the
// watch with a per-device, revocable token instead.
// Anyone who installs a TestFlight build can read this key from its Info.plist (CoachAPIToken).
// Mitigation: use only the synthetic test account's key, keep testing internal, rotate the key
// after the demo period, and never open external testing with a build that carries it.
COACH_API_TOKEN = paste-synthetic-key-here
